{
 "file_spec": 1.1,
 "file_creator": "OrigamiSimulator computation tools (computation/generate_gadgets.mjs)",
 "file_title": "Full adder (Hull–Zakharevich gadgets)",
 "file_description": "One-bit full adder: S = A xor B xor Cin, Cout = majority(A, B, Cin). A honeycomb of triangle twists from Hull & Zakharevich (arXiv:2309.07932), where some twists carry the control folds of the paper's NOR, NAND, OR and AND gates. Layout found by computation/honeycomb_search.py.",
